# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: GOGImport (part of the VCMI release).
Package: GOGImport
Section: Games
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32
Depends: SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport
Components: Apps.Games.!GOGImport (Movable LookAt)
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-vcmi
Description: Gets Heroes III's files out of the GOG installer for VCMI
 Drag the GOG.com installer of Heroes of Might and Magic III Complete
 onto it and it unpacks Data, Maps and Mp3 into !VCMI.H3data, in a
 TaskWindow, so no other computer is needed to set up VCMI. It uses
 innoextract 1.9.
Build-Map: !GOGImport -> Apps/Games/!GOGImport
Build-Notice: GOGImport, packaged for PackMan from the VCMI release on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-vcmi/releases
 .
